# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated stimulus
#
# Hex and pcap files are outputs of the C++ generator, not sources. Regenerate
# them rather than committing them -- they are large and change constantly.
# If a specific capture is needed to reproduce a bug, commit it deliberately
# with `git add -f` and a comment explaining why.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.hex
*.pcap
*.bin
 
